General
-------

In cblas calls, set some lda's.

In BTR with dynamic accuracy, predefine other terminaison tests...

BFGS
----

We should work directly with the Cholesky factors instead of the
complete Hessian approximation.
The secant initialization should be revised.

The initialization of the secant matrix should be revised.

In order to get rid off clapack, we  should use clapack_dposv from
ATLAS instead of dposvx.

Hessian approximations
----------------------

In BTR, for Gauss-Newton updates, we always update it, even if the
iterates is rejected, and so the approximation does not change...

Model computation
-----------------

The model computation should not require an explicit hessian, but
rather a routine to compute Hessian-vector product.

Terminaison messages
--------------------

Takes inspiration from DONLP2.

